essage case red; all 5 analytics member controls green); restore, rebuild, preflight --absent exit 0 (marker absent from 6 built files, tree clean). Direction: red as predicted in every leg. (6) Lint, a proven narrowing: eslint --no-inline-config --format json over all 24 changed paths at 8364f40c4a. Population from eslint's own config: 3 non-TS paths ignored by configuration, 21 linted. Count from the json output: 21 files, 0 errors, 0 warnings. Invariance: eslint.config.mjs has no parserOptions.project and no typed rules, and the diff touches no lint config or rule input. (7) pnpm check:platform-checklist: only the pre-existing identity-auth.json problem (see gates).",
